^rukx  Run with:  python -m phyx run --ascii examples/07_ascii.phyx
^rukx  In ASCII mode a capital letter stands for the special letter it resembles:
^rukx    A=A  O=O  E=E   S=S Z=Z C=C J=J W=W   TH=TH DH=DH NG=NG NN=NN LH=LH LZ=LZ
^rukx    P=P PH=PH  T=T TT=TT  K=K KH=KH  GG=GG GH=GH  G=G X=X Q=Q R=R
^rukx  so  TTE''  is  ţə''  and  THuqx  is  θuqx.  Quoted text is left alone.

^xe-"Yawgmoth"-mo'TH-TTE''.
!"father of machines:",mo'TH.

^Te-n-PHyrxbabg:
    ^lo-n-'ii-babg-'iTTpEnn.
!"one more:",0f-PHyrxbabg.

^aXEw'-i-dl-KHi-ronG:
    !i,i-KHus'Er.
